  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade levnadsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden i fattiga omr&#xe5;den i &#xe5;tta st&#xe4;der i Nicaragua. St&#xf6;det g&#xe5;r till krediter f&#xf6;r husf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar, krediter till mikrof&#xf6;retag samt infrastrukturella projekt med aktivt deltagande av lokalbefolkningen i beslutsfattande och genomf&#xf6;rande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for better living conditions in poor areas in eight cities in Nicaragua. The support is used for credits to improved housing conditions, credits to microenterprices as well as infrastructural projects with active participation from the local people in decision making and implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
